  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sauerbraten is built around a long "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "marinade",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "marinade"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of red wine vinegar, wine, and aromatics that works on the beef for two to three days. You then "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "braise",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "braise"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the meat low and slow until it falls apart at the touch of a fork. Serves 6."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The strained braising liquid is reduced and thickened with crushed ginger biscuits, which is the classic German method for the sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
